  "jcr:description": "Stryker’s small joint portfolio offers low profile implants and instrumentation addressing multiple techniques across foot and ankle and hand and wrist procedures.\r\n<br><br>\r\nIdeal for both arthroscopic and open techniques, our full line of small joint offerings is designed for maneuverability within tight compartments without sacrificing functionality. The cutting-edge  technology of our offering allows for customization across your preferred techniques.\r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n<strong>Foot and ankle focus</strong>\r\n<br>\r\nOur portfolio provides soft tissue repair solutions for achilles reconstruction, lateral ankle and medial ankle instability.",
